// DevPilot AI — Chaîne de traçabilité  (Eraser diagram-as-code)
title Traçabilité — lignée d'exécution persistée

colorMode bold
styleMode shadow
typeface clean
direction right

Message [icon: message-square, color: blue, label: "message"]

Lineage [icon: layers, color: purple] {
  AgentRuns [icon: cpu, label: "agent_runs · 7 agents"]
  RetrievedChunks [icon: file-text, label: "retrieved_chunks"]
  Evaluations [icon: shield, label: "evaluations"]
  LLMUsage [icon: dollar-sign, label: "llm_usage"]
}

Storage [icon: database, color: green, label: "PostgreSQL"]
Inspector [icon: search, color: teal, label: "AI Trace Inspector · 9 sections"]

Message > AgentRuns: 1..*
Message > RetrievedChunks: 1..*
Message > Evaluations: 1..1
Message > LLMUsage: 0..*
AgentRuns > Storage
RetrievedChunks > Storage
Evaluations > Storage
LLMUsage > Storage
Storage > Inspector: reconstruction
